# Frontend Rules

- UI implementation in React/Vite; component architecture with accessibility.
- `VITE_API_BASE_URL` is evaluated at build time; default to relative `/api` for nginx proxy compatibility.
- Production nginx image serves on port 80; dev server runs on port 5173 (Vite HMR).
- Reproducible builds: `COPY package.json package-lock.json ./` + `npm ci --no-audit --no-fund`.
- Do not commit `node_modules/`, `dist/`, or `.vite/`.
- Required checks: `npm ci`, `npm run build`.
